{"title":"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> such that the system of equations\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/3/5c3051d63b3c3cbc3622f8c916eed4f42f47a66e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[|x+y|=2007 \\\\ |x-y|=c\\]\" width=\"195\" height=\"18\" />\nhas exactly two solutions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> in real numbers.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/1/891aa812846898cba1c697faeb2998c5e64a3430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 0 \\quad \\text{(B) } 1 \\quad \\text{(C) } 2 \\quad \\text{(D) } 3 \\quad \\text{(E) } 4 \\quad \\text{(F) } 5 \\quad \\text{(G) } 6 \\quad \\text{(H) } 7 \\quad \\text{(I) } 8 \\quad \\text{(J) } 9 \\quad \\text{(K) } 10 \\quad \\text{(L) } 11 \\quad \\text{(M) } 12 \\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"733\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/a/6ea858646abb9b14988e5b5770a49c38aaf8f8e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(N) } 13 \\quad \\text{(O) } 14 \\quad \\text{(P) } 15 \\quad \\text{(Q) } 16 \\quad \\text{(R) } 17 \\quad \\text{(S) } 18 \\quad \\text{(T) } 223 \\quad \\text{(U) } 678 \\quad \\text{(V) } 2007 \\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"606\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/f/c8fdd87f8e71ac3b96b1b7154b170e4600ea1b29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007|x-y|=c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" /> must be one line; otherwise, the system would have four solutions. This occurs at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/2/5f2cfac83e1bf8cc9ab2ba7e376653c2bfa2a185.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=\\boxed{0\\ \\text{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"83\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest\" title=\"2007 iTest\">2007 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 iTest Answer Key\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl